//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Schedule
// When the Moss Merchant appears.
//   Year: The year it starts. A wildcard means every year.
//   Month: The month it starts, 1 to 12. A wildcard means every month.
//   Day: The day of the month it starts, 1 to 31. A wildcard means every day.
//   Day of the week: -1 Every day | 1 Sunday | 2 Monday | 3 Tuesday | 4 Wednesday | 5 Thursday | 6 Friday | 7 Saturday
//   Hour: The hour it starts, 0 to 23. A wildcard means every hour.
//   Minute: The minute it starts, 0 to 59. A wildcard means every minute.
//   Second: The second it starts, 0 to 59.
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [Number]    [*/0~12]    [*/0~31]    [*/1~7]      [*/0~23]    [*/0~59]    [*/0~59]
//  Year        Month       Day         DayOfWeek    Hour        Minute      Second
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    *           *           *           *            2           0           0
    *           *           *           *            8           0           0
    *           *           *           *            14          0           0
    *           *           *           *            20          0           0
end

1
//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Gamble Items
// The items the merchant sells, the group each belongs to and the chance of each option (a row of ItemOptionRate.txt). The comment at the end of each row names the item.
//   Item: The item the pack can give.
//   Group: The gamble pack that can give it: 0 is the first Moss pack item (13,71) and 4 the fifth (13,75).
//   Item level: The number of the row of ItemOptionRate.txt that sets the chance.
//   Skill: The number of the row of ItemOptionRate.txt that sets the chance.
//   Luck: The number of the row of ItemOptionRate.txt that sets the chance.
//   Additional option: The number of the row of ItemOptionRate.txt that sets the chance.
//   Excellent options: The number of the row of ItemOptionRate.txt that sets the chance.
//   Ancient option: The number of the row of ItemOptionRate.txt that sets the chance.
//   Socket: The number of the row of ItemOptionRate.txt that sets the chance.
//   Chance: Weight of this item inside its group: the higher it is compared with the others in the group, the more often it comes out. 0 never.
//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~8191]     [0~4]    [Number]    [Number]    [Number]    [Number]    [Number]    [Number]    [Number]    [0~10000]
//  ItemIndex    Group    Option0     Option1     Option2     Option3     Option4     Option5     Option6     GambleRate
